@format 1
@id import.losslesscut-detection
@title Detect adjacent LosslessCut project
@area 2. Media discovery and import
@entry input
@summary Inspect adjacent LosslessCut projects in order and transfer an accepted candidate to the import operation.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@allow-cycle true
@related import.losslesscut-import
@tag losslesscut
@tag detection

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias lossless = Cadroue.Media.LLosslesscut

[input] Media attachment requests adjacent-project detection <input>
- Begin adjacent LosslessCut discovery for the active media @ flow.PFlowLosslesscutFind(...)
> discover

[discover] Discover candidates <decision>
- Find adjacent LosslessCut project files @ lossless.LLosslesscutAdjacentRead(...)
? "At least one candidate exists" > inspect
? "No candidate exists" > none

[inspect] Inspect next candidate <decision>
- Read the candidate project @ lossless.LLosslesscutRead(...)
- Present its file, version, segment count, and declared media @ flow.PFlowLosslesscutFind(...)
? "User accepts this candidate" > transfer
? "User declines and another candidate exists" > inspect [loop]
? "User declines the last candidate" > none
? "Candidate read fails" > inspect [loop]

[transfer] Continue with import <output>
> map:import.losslesscut-import

[none] Detection ends <output>
= Existing sections are unchanged.
